cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "citation-ready"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free command-line tool that checks a web page for the structural
  signals observed on content that AI answer engines tend to quote and recommend.
  Reports observed correlations, not guarantees: a high score means a page
  resembles pages that get cited, and does not promise a citation.
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-07-31"
